1
00:00:06,870 --> 00:00:10,410
(Leonard:)Nice shot.
Thank you.

2
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:14,480
(Sheldon:)My father taught me archery
as a child.

3
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,820
(Sheldon:)It's odd how the activity

4
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:22,820
(Sheldon:)brings back the smell
of Kmart bourbon.

5
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:27,060
(Leonard:)Perfect.
I know.

6
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:29,590
(Sheldon:)What an elf
I would have made.

7
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,230
(Sheldon:)Whoo.

8
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:33,400
(Sheldon:)What do you think you're doing?

9
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,930
(Leonard:)Shooting at a target?

10
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:35,900
(Sheldon:)With what?

11
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:38,070
(Leonard:)An arrow.
Really?

12
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:41,000
(Sheldon:)I didn't see you draw one
from your quiver.

13
00:00:41,010 --> 00:00:43,070
(Leonard:)I'm not going to do that,
Sheldon.

14
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:46,080
(Sheldon:)Leonard, the people at Nintendo
can only go so far

15
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:49,550
(Sheldon:)in helping us recreate
an actual athletic experience.

16
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:51,610
(Sheldon:)We have to do our part, too.

17
00:00:58,020 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)That was uncalled for,
but...

